            "id": 72154,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sayıyı bir değişkenin değerinden çıkarmak için hangi operatörü kullanırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkenin değerinden sayı çıkarmak için hangi operatörü kullanırız? <code>3</code> kullanarak <code>12</code>'yi <code>9</code> yap.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>-=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 72155,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkenin değerine bir ekleyen operatör hangisidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>++</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sayaç <code>7</code>'dir ve <code>8</code> sayısını yazmadan <code>8</code> olmalıdır. Bu tek adımlık değişikliği hangi operatör yapar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>++</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 72156,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>199</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>speed--;</code> yerine <code>speed++;</code> yazıp programı çalıştırıyorsun. Konsol şimdi ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">201</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">199</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">200</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">201 öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: += operator",
            "id": 72159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+=</code> operatörünü kullanarak değişkenin değerine on ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" yards = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yards += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(yards);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>yards</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+=</code> operatörü geçerli değere bir sayı ekler ve sonucu aynı değişkende saklar.</p><p>Bu operatörle <code>yards</code> değerini <code>10</code> artır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" yards = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yards += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(yards);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"++\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"80\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>yards</code>, ardından <code>+</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>10</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: -= operator",
            "id": 72160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>-=</code> operatörünü kullanarak değişkenin değerinden 200 çıkar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"account -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(account);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"800\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-=</code>, ardından <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>-=</code> operatörü geçerli değerden bir sayı çıkarır ve sonucu aynı değişkende saklar.</p><p>Bu operatörle <code>account</code> değerinden <code>200</code> tutarındaki ödemeyi çıkar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"account -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(account);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"800\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>account</code>, ardından <code>-=</code> ve son olarak <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
